615&utm_source=chatgpt.com\ue201\n\n---\n\n\ue200image_group\ue202{\"query\":[\"BLUETTI AC180 portable power station with 200W folding solar panel\"],\"aspect_ratio\":\"1:1\",\"layout\":\"carousel\",\"num_per_query\":1}\ue201\n\nBest battery capacity\n\n**\ue200entity\ue202[\"product\",\"BLUETTI AC180 + 200W solar panel kit\"]\ue201**\n\n## \\$769 reported bundle price\n\n1,152Wh battery \u00b7 1,800W AC \u00b7 200W solar panel\n\nMore battery storage and higher continuous output than the Jackery 1000 v2. Good for appliances with moderate starting surges.\n\n\ue200url\ue202View bundle comparison and offer\ue202https://dealectric.com/best-solar-generator-kit-under-1000-for-home-backup\ue201\n\n---\n\n\ue200image_group\ue202{\"query\":[\"Anker SOLIX C1000 Gen 2 portable power station with 200W bifacial solar panel\"],\"aspect_ratio\":\"1:1\",\"layout\":\"carousel\",\"num_per_query\":1}\ue201\n\nBest high-output option\n\n**\ue200entity\ue202[\"turn762548product1\",\"Anker SOLIX C1000X Gen 2 (1,024Wh) Solar Generator w/ 200W B\u2026\"]\ue201**\n\n## \\$859.99\n\n1,024Wh battery \u00b7 2,000W AC \u00b7 200W solar panel\n\nStrong AC output for its size, with room to add more solar later. Particularly appealing for powering multiple devices.\n\n\ue200url\ue202View kit at Lowe's\ue202https://www.lowes.com/pd/Anker-SOLIX-C1000X-Gen-2-1-024Wh-Solar-Generator-w-200W-Bifacial-Portable-Solar-Panel-2000-Watts-Portable-Power-Station-1-Solar-Panel-Included/5021303037?utm_medium=feed&utm_source=chatgpt.com\ue201\n\n## Side-by-side comparison\n\n| Kit | Battery | Solar panel | Price |\n|--------|--------|--------|--------|\n| Jackery Explorer 1000 v2 | 1,070Wh | 200W | \\$769 |\n| BLUETTI AC180 | 1,152Wh | 200W | \\~\\$769 |\n| Anker SOLIX C1000 Gen 2 | 1,024Wh | 200W | \\$859.99 |\n| ALLPO |  |  |  |"},{"p":"/message/metadata/safe_urls/4","o":"replace","v":"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-1/u2TBSfZYcROF3JdNFpo83h3r9BlvLANIY1L_z_QB_lx6ccQL3MAfN2zgKsYpd8mQVWtLwR-1IY4PMcpTAeshZ-I